      "role": "user",
      "content": "Interesting. So if we're looking at those \"blind spots\" like deadweight loss and the loss of autonomy, how do we frame this to a general audience so it doesn't just sound like economic jargon? What's the most effective way to characterize the fundamental character of a democratic socialist approach to make it clearly seem unsustainable to the average voter?",
